---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../../site.config";
const person = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Person",
  name: siteConfig.author.name,
  url: `${siteConfig.url}/author/`,
  jobTitle: siteConfig.author.role,
  worksFor: { "@type": "Organization", name: siteConfig.name, url: siteConfig.url },
};
---
<Base title={siteConfig.author.name} description={siteConfig.author.bio} path="/author/" jsonLd={[person]}>
  <main id="content" class="article">
    <h1>{siteConfig.author.name}</h1>
    <p>{siteConfig.author.bio}</p>
    <p>전화번호와 주소는 올리지 않습니다. 문의는 사이트 메일로 주세요.</p>
    <p><a href="/contact/">{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
